  "question": {
    "text": "Let a differentiable function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;satisfy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced></math> is equal to:",
    "image": null
  },
